# Web3Forms access key — used by the Contact form on the V4 page.
# Get one (no signup) at https://web3forms.com/#start by entering the
# destination email; they email back an access key.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is gitignored) and fill in your key.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
